#, no-c-format
msgid "Using &ksig;"
msgstr "Koristeći &ksig;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:88
#, no-c-format
msgid "Managing signatures"
msgstr "Upravljanje potpisima"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Open the application launcher and select <menuchoice><guimenu>Utilities</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>&ksig; (Signature Editor)</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"
msgstr ""
"Otvorite pokretač aplikacije i selektujte <menuchoice><guimenu>Utilities</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>&ksig; (Signature Editor)</guimenuitem></menuchoice>"

#. Tag: screeninfo
#: index.docbook:97
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here's a screenshot of &ksig;"
msgstr "Ovdje je slika ekrana od &ksig;"

#. Tag: phrase
#: index.docbook:103
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshot"
msgstr "Slika ekrana"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:110
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a new signature"
msgstr "Kreiranje novog potpisa"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create a new signature, go to <menuchoice> <shortcut> <keycombo action="
"\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu>File</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>. This will create an "
"<guilabel>&lt;empty signature&gt;</guilabel> in the <guilabel>Signatures</"
"guilabel> section. <mousebutton>Left</mousebutton> click the &lt;empty "
"signature&gt; and in the bottom section type in your new signature. "
"<example> <title>Signature example</title> <screen>\n"
"Mr. Konqi\n"
"konqi@kde.org\n"
"http://www.kde.org\n"
"</screen> </example> Once you have completed your signature, save it by "
"going to <menuchoice> <shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>S</"
"keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu>File</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Save</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice>, or by pressing the <guibutton>Save</guibutton> "
"button (floppy disc icon)."
msgstr ""
"Da kreirate novi potpis, idite ne <menuchoice> <shortcut> <keycombo action="
"\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu>Datoteke</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Novi</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>. Ovo će kreirati "
"<guilabel>&lt;empty signature&gt;</guilabel>  u  <guilabel>Signatures</"
"guilabel> odjeljku. <mousebutton>Lijevo</mousebutton> kliknite &lt;prazan "
"potpis&gt; a i odjeljku na dnu ukucajte vaš novi potpis. <example> "
"<title>Primjer potpisa</title> <screen>\n"
"Mr. Konqi\n"
"konqi@kde.org\n"
"http://www.kde.org\n"
"</screen> </example> Nakon što završite vaš potpis, spasite ga odlaskom na "
"<menuchoice> <shortcut> <keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>S</keycap></"
"keycombo> </shortcut> <guimenu>Datoteke</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Spasi</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice>, ili klikom na <guibutton>Spasi</guibutton> dugme "
"(ikona diskete)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:130
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you want to use the same first or last lines of text in your signatures "
"use the menu items <guimenuitem>Edit Standard Header</guimenuitem> or "
"<guimenuitem>Edit Standard Footer</guimenuitem> from the <guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu> menu."
msgstr ""
"Ako želite koristiti istu prvu ili posljednju liniju teksta u vašem potpisu "
"koristite izbornik <guimenuitem>Uredite standarno uzglavlje</guimenuitem> or "
"<guimenuitem>Uredite standarno podnožje</guimenuitem> iz <guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu> izbornika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:135
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can create as many signatures as you would like. Doing so provides you "
"with a list of signatures to use in email applications such as &kmail;, so "
"no matter how informal or professional you need to be, there will always be "
"an available signature."
msgstr ""
"Možete kreirati potpisa koliko god želite. Na taj način vam  se pruža listu "
"potpisa za korištenje u e-mail aplikacijama kao što su &kmail;, tako da bez "
"obzira koliko neformalni ili profesionalni morate biti, uvijek će biti "
"dostupan potpis."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid "Deleting a signature"
msgstr "Brisanje potpisa"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:144
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To remove a signature first select the signature that you want to remove and "
"then click <menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Remove</"
"guimenuitem></menuchoice>, or by clicking the <guibutton>Remove</guibutton> "
"button with the red x icon in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Da uklonite potpis prvo selektujte potpis koji želite ukloniti i kliknite na "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Datoteke</guimenu><guimenuitem>Ukloni</guimenuitem></"
"menuchoice>, ili klikom na <guibutton>Ukloni</guibutton> dugme sa crvenom x "
"ikonom na alatnoj traci."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:152
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding signatures to &kmail;"
msgstr "Dodavanje potpisa na &kmail;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:154
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding signatures is pretty straight forward."
msgstr "Dodavanje potpisa je prilično direktno."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Open &kmail; and go to <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure KMail...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> In the "
"<guilabel>Identities</guilabel> page, highlight the identity to add the "
"signature to and then press the <guibutton>Modify...</guibutton> button on "
"the right-hand side of the window."
msgstr ""
"Otvorite &kmail; i idite na <menuchoice><guimenu>Postavke</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Konfigurišite KMail...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> u "
"<guilabel>Identiteti</guilabel> strani, označite identitet da dodate potpis "
"i pritisnite  <guibutton>Modificiraj...</guibutton> dugme na desnoj strani "
"prozora."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select the <guilabel>Signature</guilabel> tab. Check the <guilabel>Enable "
"signature</guilabel> box. From the <guilabel>Obtain signature text from</"
"guilabel> drop down, select <guimenuitem>Output of Command</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"Selektujte <guilabel>Potpis</guilabel> karticu.  Provjerite "
"<guilabel>Uključi potpis</guilabel> prostor. Od <guilabel>Nabavite tekst "
"potpisa iz</guilabel> padajući, odaberite <guimenuitem>Izlaz Komandi</"
"guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:164
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Now you have the choice to enter two different command in the "
"<guilabel>Specify command</guilabel> text box to add the signatures you "
"created with &ksig;:"
msgstr ""
"Sada imate izboe da ukucate dvije različite komande u  "
"<guilabel>Specificiraj komandu</guilabel> tekst prostor da dodate potpis "
"koji ste kreirali sa &ksig;:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<command>ksig --daily</command>: Use the same random signature for one day."
msgstr ""
"<command>ksig --daily</command>: Koristite isti nasumični potpis za jedan "
"dan."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid "<command>ksig --random</command>: Use random signatures for each mail."
msgstr ""
"<command>ksig --random</command>: Koristite nasumični potpis za svaki mail."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid "and then press the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button."
msgstr "zatim pritisnite <guibutton>OK</guibutton> dugme."

